msgid "About"
msgstr "关于"

msgid "A sleep screen with a reading summary card: cover, reading time, progress, pace and streak."
msgstr "一个带有阅读摘要卡片的休眠屏幕：封面、阅读时间、进度、速度和连续阅读天数。"

